* Thu Dec 11 2025 Ruidong Tian <tianruidong@linux.alibaba.com> [6.6.102-5.2.1_rc1%%DIST%%]
- anolis: riscv: Enable APEI GHES driver and SSE driver in anolis defconfig (Lu Peng)
- riscv: Enable APEI and NMI safe cmpxchg options required for RAS (Himanshu Chauhan)
